@startuml
title Restaurant System — Despliegue de pruebas en HomeLab

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Usuario / navegador" as User

node "HomeLab" {
  node "Docker / host de demostración" {
    component "Frontend container\nReact build + reverse proxy" as Front
    component "Backend container\nASP.NET Core 10" as Back
  }

  database "PostgreSQL existente\nen HomeLab" as DB
}

User --> Front : HTTP/HTTPS
Front --> Back : /api/v1
Front --> Back : /hubs/kitchen\nWebSocket
Back --> DB : Npgsql

note right of Front
/
→ React SPA

/api/
→ backend

/hubs/
→ SignalR
end note

note bottom of DB
Credenciales e IP:
variables de entorno,
no Git.
end note
@enduml
